Hi Avery,

Next.js Conf 2026 is Wednesday, October 21, in San Francisco and online.

This year's program:
- Keynote: Next.js 16 and what the App Router looks like at scale
- Sessions on partial prerendering, caching, and the new form APIs
- Founder track: shipping a product with a team of three
- Hands-on: migrating from the Pages Router in an afternoon

The virtual pass is free and includes every session recording. In-person passes are $299, with a discount for companies on the Vercel Startup Program.

